---
import AppLayout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---
<AppLayout title="Interactive Forms" appShell={true}>
 <div id="form-builder"><a href="/dashboard/services">← Chat Services</a><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-4">Interactive Forms</h1><p>Build → Save → Test → Publish → Activate → Review submissions</p>
 <p id="form-notice" role="status" class="mt-4"></p>
 <section class="fbcard"><label>Project<select id="form-project"></select></label><label>Chat Service<select id="form-service"></select></label><button id="form-refresh">Refresh forms</button><a href="/dashboard/features">Feature availability</a></section>
 <section class="fbcard"><h2>Saved forms</h2><div id="form-list"></div><label>Starting template<select id="form-template"><option value="blank">Blank form</option><option value="contact">Contact request</option><option value="support">Support request</option></select></label><button id="form-new">Create a draft</button></section>
 <section id="form-editor" class="fbcard" hidden><h2 id="editor-heading">New form</h2><p id="form-version"></p>
 <label>Title<input id="form-title" maxlength="120" required/></label><label>Purpose and data-use explanation<textarea id="form-description" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><label>Confirmation message<input id="form-confirmation" maxlength="500" value="Your request was received."/></label><label>Retain answers for (days)<input id="form-retention" type="number" min="1" max="365" value="30"/></label><label><input id="form-widget" type="checkbox"/> Show a form link in this service's Web Chat widgets</label>
 <h2>Fields</h2><p>Field keys identify answers and must stay stable when used by conditions or connector mappings. Conditions refer to an earlier field.</p><div id="form-fields"></div><button id="field-add">Add field</button>
 <details><summary>Optional business action</summary><p>Map this form to a connector action. A staff member must review the submission, prepare the action and approve it separately in Integrations.</p><label><input id="form-action-enabled" type="checkbox"/> Prepare a business action after review</label><label>Connected system<select id="form-connector"></select></label><label>Action<select id="form-operation"><option value="create_ticket">Create support ticket</option><option value="create_lead">Create contact</option><option value="request_booking">Request booking (business API only)</option></select></label><div id="form-mapping"></div></details>
 <div class="fbactions"><button id="form-save">Save draft</button><button id="form-test">Save and create test link</button><button id="form-publish">Publish saved draft</button><button id="form-activate">Activate published form</button><button id="form-deactivate">Deactivate</button><a id="form-link" hidden target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open customer form</a></div><p>Publication affects new sessions. Existing sessions keep their original version. Deactivation stops unfinished sessions without deleting their answers.</p></section>
 <section class="fbcard"><h2>Submissions</h2><p>Starts include unfinished sessions. Only completed, non-test submissions can prepare business actions. Personal answers are restricted to owners and admins.</p><div id="form-submissions"></div><button id="submissions-next" hidden>Load next page</button><div id="submission-detail"></div></section>
 </div><script src="/form-builder.js" is:inline></script>
 <style is:global>#form-builder .fbcard{margin-top:22px;padding:22px;border:1px solid #dce4ed;border-radius:12px;background:white}#form-builder h2{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin:14px 0}#form-builder label{display:block;margin:12px 0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}#form-builder input:not([type=checkbox]),#form-builder select,#form-builder textarea{display:block;width:100%;max-width:650px;border:1px solid #a8b8ca;padding:9px;border-radius:6px;font:inherit;margin-top:5px}#form-builder textarea{min-height:80px}#form-builder button,#form-builder .fbactions a{display:inline-block;border:1px solid #b4c3d6;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:6px;margin:8px 8px 8px 0;background:#edf3ff;color:#16418a}#form-builder button:disabled{opacity:.45}#form-builder .field-row{background:#f7f9fc;padding:18px;margin:14px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #dce4ed}#form-builder .field-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:12px}#form-builder p{font-size:14px;color:#52677c;margin:10px 0}#form-builder pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}#form-builder [hidden]{display:none!important}</style>
</AppLayout>
